# Generic secret/credential safety net — catches keys, tokens, and
# credential files regardless of which integration introduces them
# (e.g. Nextcloud app passwords, future API integrations), so nothing
# needs to be added here per-integration to stay safe by default.
*credentials*.json
*credentials*.yaml
*credentials*.yml
*_secret*
*secrets*.json
*secrets*.yaml
*secrets*.yml
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
.netrc
.aws/
.ssh/
*.jwt
*_token
*_token.txt

